  "body": "Reported in the re-review of PR #3308 by its reviewer, on plain main `4c0a8dfe3` (without that PR). The post-merge run of that commit did not finish yet.\n\n## What happens\n\n`cargo test -p camcraft-app --test first_router_part`: 3 passed, 1 failed.\n\n```text\nthread 'first_router_part_project_loads_verifies_and_posts_to_grblhal' panicked at crates/app/tests/first_router_part.rs:282:5:\nassertion `left == right` failed: committed demo matches command build\n```\n\nThe same step was green on main `10a0a39c0`.\n\n## Likely cause (not confirmed)\n\nA merge between `10a0a39c0` and `4c0a8dfe3` changed a toolpath that the committed demo project holds. Candidates: PR #3684 (2D Contour with tabs: the levels above the tabs start at a new point) and PR #2890 (rest machining on the 2D Adaptive). The demo file was not regenerated.\n\n## Done means\n\n- The cause is named with the commit.\n- If the new toolpath is the intended one: the committed demo is regenerated by its documented command, and the diff of the posted program is read and described in the PR. If the change is not intended: the generator is fixed.\n- `first_router_part` is green.\n",
